! mcp_bootstrap_p237.strap -- MCP printed page 237: the Input Program's
! write / sweep / read tables (exit vectors, VF/XW/CW words, DRZ
! reservations), lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.244, read at 400 dpi.  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD ID CA001042  DIST. OF 3/01
! 3/01  PAGE NUMBER 237"; the heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK --
! line 1 is a CNOP that compiles nothing and prints no location.
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines; lines 2-56 located, contiguous from 225263.00 to
! 225337.00 (a half word; next location 225337.40).  The volume reading
! of p.236 ends with DRZ(BU,32),V SCK at 225260.00, size 000003.00, so
! line 1's CNOP falls on a word (225263.00) and emits nothing; p.238's
! line 1 reads 225337.40.  Both joins hold.  Asterisks after the LOCATION
! on lines 20, 22, 41, 43.
!
! REMARKS.  Two remark fields: a mnemonic one ("-W2S", "-NX", "-SU" ...)
! and a sequence number -1014 .. -1067.  The sequence number is absent on
! lines 2, 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 16, 35, 42 (16 and 35 skip -1028 and -1047);
! line 43 prints its -1054 to the left of the usual column.  On lines
! 29, 30, 32, 50, 53 the mnemonic remark abuts the statement
! ("V SX2KT-S2S"): the binary shows it is NOT part of the operand
! (229/30 address 225323 = V SX2KT exactly).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * worn O printing as C: line 2/6 "V WECP" = VWEOP (p.218, 224322.40;
!     B prints 224322.50); line 4 "V WFECP" = VWFEOP (p.219); lines 24/46
!     "V REOP"/"V RECP" = VREOP (p.227); lines 34/55 "V RTIC" = VRTIO and
!     line 39 "V RTIC1" = VRTIO1 (p.221, 224421.40 / 224422.00); line 15
!     "V WIC" = VWIO (p.221, 224403.40).  Each B's printed address equals
!     the landed label's location.
!   * line 14 "V RDQ" (p.216 VRDQ 224233.40), line 54 "V QQ" (p.222 VQQ
!     224452.40), line 33 "V SQ" (p.218 VSQ 224314.00) -- landed spellings,
!     binary agrees.
!   * line 30 operand printed "V SZT"/"V S2T" read as VS2T: binary 225324.00
!     = line 42's V S2T.
!   * "C" in VF,C (lines 18, 19), CW,C (13) is 0: every octal field of
!     those rows is zero.  Line 8 "VF,-34.C" is -34.0.
!   * hex bytes printed with an open round ("C0") are 00; octal fields
!     "CCCCCC.CC" are 0.
!
! DATA ROWS.  VF prints its value with sign; XW/CW print value, the
! count/flags, and the refill address.  DRZ rows (22, 43, 44) print their
! size and get no !CHECK; the SYN (26) prints NULL, +00000002.

